        <activityName xml:lang="en">Power supply unit, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Power supply unit, at plant
This dataset is a rough estimation of the material composition of the PSU in a desktop PC due to own measurements. Dataset update was made in 2023, showing new material composition from the literature; UUID: 3306ddd8-3d7c-35dc-84c1-11261935e335
This dataset contains the material inputs that build up all together a power supply unit for a desktop PC. Requirements and emissions of the assembly process (energy, emissions, waste) are not included.
Location: Data of a Chinese product; commonly used in current desktop PC.
Technology: The dataset represents the material composition of a PSU, model ST-235ATX, from a Chinese producer.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own dismantling &amp; estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3306ddd8-3d7c-35dc-84c1-11261935e335.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
